<p>A <code>FiveStarRatingPickerButton</code> is one star inside
  a <a href="/components/five-star-rating-picker/"><code>FiveStarRatingPicker</code></a>.
  Each button is a <code>&lt;button role="radio"&gt;</code> with
  <code>data-value</code> (1–5) and an auto-generated aria-label
  like "Rate 4 stars".</p>

<p>See the <a href="/components/five-star-rating-picker/">Picker
  demo</a> for composed examples.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;FiveStarRatingPicker label="Rate this product"&gt;
    &lt;FiveStarRatingPickerButton value="1" label="1 star" onclick={handleClick} /&gt;
    &lt;FiveStarRatingPickerButton value="2" label="2 stars" onclick={handleClick} /&gt;
    &lt;FiveStarRatingPickerButton value="3" label="3 stars" selected onclick={handleClick} /&gt;
    &lt;FiveStarRatingPickerButton value="4" label="4 stars" onclick={handleClick} /&gt;
    &lt;FiveStarRatingPickerButton value="5" label="5 stars" onclick={handleClick} /&gt;
&lt;/FiveStarRatingPicker&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
